  Oil: A Practical Guide and How to Tell if Your Olive Oil is Fake! Quick K
 itchen Tip! Listener Pick Shirley &#8211\; I Told You So ! by Matt Kaplan 
 Intro music is by&nbsp\; Ronald Jenkees Send your virology questions and c
 omments to twiv@microbe.tv Content in this podcast should not be construed
