 control that possibly predates the emergence of CRISPR pathways\, and the 
 possibility that Alzheimer&#8217\;s Disease neuropathology evolved as a ho
 st defense response to microbial infection in the brain. Hosts:&nbsp\; Vin
 cent Racaniello \, Alan Dove \, and Brianne Barker Click arrow to play Dow
